  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You combine fear and wrath into a great force.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Menacing Bane<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use Menacing Bane your melee weapon is considered both menacing and bane.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you have the Double Bane feat, both weapons you wield are considered bane and menacing.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
